## What this round produced

Scenario ZX — "COILSHAW / Loopercroft Hot Strip FM-7": a 7-stand
finishing train mid-hold at 10.4 m/s rolling 1.82 mm coil. Three
heterogeneous, individually-correct agents — PYRO (setup-model T),
