in-band because the setup model assumes round rolls. LOOP 8.4 kN sits
inside 6.5-10.5 because one F4 looper is 1 of 6. GAGE 1.82 sits inside
1.76-1.88 because F5-F7 AGC take the extra draft. Uncommissioned
r_spall is 1184 C against a 1020 hold. Uncommissioned r_shape is
2.41 mm against a 1.95 hold. The coordination-failure CLASS is new to
this factory: WORK-ROLL SPALL CERTIFICATE OF A MILL-MEAN STRIP.
Completes a different family than r01-r04 and staged r14-r55. Distinct
from r29 caster (mold level), r42 blast furnace (burden hang), r49 EAF
(water panel), and r52 coke oven (through-wall crack). Here every
agent is correct, the mill is not unstable, and the playbook's three
