- Sidecars: raster spikes 54 == round(168 x 8.0 x 0.040); energy 1242 pJ /
  0.001242 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 40000] us,
  neuron_id < 168, same-neuron gap unique-ids / >=1000 us; routing 4
  entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 6.4 s
  == 6400 ms; gate_snn pools 45/18/6 == round(n x rate x 0.028) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (work-roll spall certificate of a
mill-mean strip), the domain (hot-strip-mill-finishing), the mill-pace
